B.Hb=new A.c1("Maritime Museum","Discover Rotterdam through ships, harbour stories, and inventions that shaped the city. A place where movement, trade, and history meet the water.","Leuvehaven 1, 3011 EA Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/urban1.PNG",0.46,0.57)
B.Hn=new A.c1("Oude Haven","One of Rotterdam's oldest harbours filled with historic boats, reflections, and waterfront atmosphere. Perfect for slowing down and feeling the city's maritime past.","3011 ZP Rotterdam","Always Open","assets/images/urban2.PNG",0.54,0.55)
B.Hf=new A.c1("Port Pavilion","An interactive introduction to Europe's largest port. Explore how Rotterdam moves, works, and connects with the world.","Schiedamsedijk 68, 3011 EK Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/urban3.PNG",0.46,0.6)
B.Hm=new A.c1("SS Rotterdam","Step onto a legendary ocean liner and experience travel from another era. Giant engines, elegant interiors, and stories from journeys across the sea.","3e Katendrechtse Hoofd 25, 3072 AM Rotterdam","By Appointment Only","assets/images/urban4.PNG",0.41,0.69)
B.ER=s([B.Hb,B.Hn,B.Hf,B.Hm],t.xv)
B.Hh=new A.c1("The Cube Houses","Walk inside a bold, unconventional forest of tilted yellow houses angled at 54.7 degrees","Overblaak 70, 3011 MH Rotterdam","Monday-Sunday 11:00-17:00","assets/images/visionary1.PNG",0.51,0.55)
B.Hs=new A.c1("The Depot Boijman","A mirrored building where architecture becomes part of the experience. See the city reflected while exploring the hidden world behind museum collections.","Museumpark 24, 3015 CX Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/visionary2.PNG",0.43,0.59)
B.Ho=new A.c1("Erasmus Bridge",'Walk across "The Swan," the sleek, asymmetric suspension bridge that serves as the ultimate icon of Rotterdam\'s skyline.',"Erasmusbrug, 3011 BN Rotterdam","Always open","assets/images/visionary3.PNG",0.48,0.62)
B.Hj=new A.c1("Stadhuis","A rare historic building that survived the bombing of Rotterdam. Classical architecture standing between the modern city around it.","Coolsingel 40, 3011 AD Rotterdam"," Monday-Friday 8:30-17:00","assets/images/visionary3.PNG",0.4,0.48)
B.EU=s([B.Hh,B.Hs,B.Ho,B.Hj],t.xv)
B.Hg=new A.c1("Huis Sonneveld","Walk through a perfectly preserved modernist home from the 1930s. Every object, colour, and detail was designed with purpose.","Jongkindstraat 12, 3015 CG Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/modernist1.PNG",0.44,0.57)
B.Hl=new A.c1("Van Nelle Factory","A UNESCO modernist masterpiece built around light, air, and efficiency. Industrial design that still feels futuristic today.","Van Nelleweg 1, 3044 BC Rotterdam","Mon - Fri 09:00 - 17:00","assets/images/modernist2.PNG",0.17,0.52)
B.Hd=new A.c1("Justus van Effencomplex","An early social housing project that changed how people imagined city living. Functional, thoughtful, and built around community.","Justus van Effenstraat, 3027 TA Rotterdam","TBD","assets/images/modernist3.PNG",0.19,0.6)
B.Ht=new A.c1("Kiefhoek House","A small modernist house showing how smart design transformed everyday life. Minimal space, maximum function.","Hendrik Idoplein 2, 3073 RC Rotterdam","By Appointment Only","assets/images/modernist3.PNG",0.58,0.71)
B.E6=s([B.Hg,B.Hl,B.Hd,B.Ht],t.xv)
B.Hc=new A.c1("Fenix Museum","A museum focused on migration, movement, and belonging. Discover personal stories that shaped Rotterdam and the world.","Paul Nijghkade 5, 3072 AT Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/cultural1.PNG",0.46,0.67)
B.Hr=new A.c1("Wereldmuseum","Explore objects, traditions, and stories from cultures around the world. A place about identity, connection, and human experience.","Willemskade 25, 3016 DM Rotterdam","Tuesday  -  Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/cultural2.PNG",0.44,0.63)
B.Hq=new A.c1("Stories House Belv\xe9d\xe8re","A community space where personal stories become part of the city's history. Listen, connect, and discover Rotterdam through its people","Rechthuislaan 1, 3072 LB Rotterdam","Monday-Sunday 10:00-17:00","assets/images/cultural3.PNG",0.47,0.68)
B.Eb=s([B.Hc,B.Hr,B.Hq],t.xv)
B.Hi=new A.c1("Natural History Museum","A quiet world of animals, fossils, and natural curiosities hidden in the middle of the city. Perfect for noticing life exhisting around us.","Westzeedijk 345, 3015 AA Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 11:00 - 17:00","assets/images/nature1.PNG",0.43,0.6)
B.He=new A.c1("Trompenburg Gardens & Arboretum","Escape the city through hidden gardens, flowers, and rare trees. A calm space made for wandering slowly.","Honingerdijk 86, 3062 NX Rotterdam","Monday 12:00-17:00, Tuesday-Sunday 10:00-17:00","assets/images/nature2.PNG",0.67,0.55)
B.Ha=new A.c1("Kunsthal: Flowers Forever","Walk through an immersive, sensory exhibition exploring the rich cultural, artistic, and natural history of the flower.","Museumpark, Westzeedijk 341, 3015 AA Rotterdam","Tuesday - Sunday 10:00 - 17:00","assets/images/nature3.PNG",0.41,0.61)
