B.H9=new A.c1("BRUTUS","A raw, artist-driven playground spanning 6,000 square meters of confrontational sculpture and industrial art. ","Keileweg 10B, 3029 BS Rotterdam","Thursday-Sunday 12:00-18:00","assets/images/contemporary2.PNG",0.15,0.62)
B.Hk=new A.c1("Kunstinstituut Melly","A vibrant, experimental hub for bold contemporary art that challenges traditional rules.","Witte de Withstraat 50, 3012 BR Rotterdam","Wednesday-Sunday 11:00-18:00, Friday 11:00-21:00","assets/images/contemporary3.PNG",0.4,0.6)
